{
  "area": "mechanic-combat",
  "description": "The combat decision layer (packages/core/docs/mechanic-predicates.md §4): who may be attacked, with what, from how far, and whether the blow means anything. Each kb mirrors packages/core/src/prolog/mechanics/combat-predicates.ts verbatim, then adds a town-watch/outlaws/undead world; a native engine consults the same clauses. Core owns none of hit detection, damage rolls or initiative — those are host concerns and have no predicates (§11).",
